{"id":"apex_enum_System_TriggerOperation","title":"TriggerOperation Enum","content":"<a name=\"apex_enum_System_TriggerOperation\"><!-- --></a><h1 class=\"helpHead1\">TriggerOperation Enum</h1><div class=\"body refbody\">\n<div class=\"shortdesc\"><span class=\"ph\" id=\"shortdesc\"><a name=\"shortdesc\"><!-- --></a>System.TriggerOperation enum values are associated with trigger\n      events.</span></div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n<h2 class=\"helpHead2\">Enum Values</h2>\n\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">Here are the values of the <samp class=\"codeph apex_code\">System.TriggerOperation</samp>\n        enum listed by their ordinal value.</p>\n\n      <ul class=\"ul bulletList\">\n        <li class=\"li\">0: <samp class=\"codeph \">BEFORE_INSERT</samp>\n</li>\n\n        <li class=\"li\">1: <samp class=\"codeph \">AFTER_INSERT</samp>\n</li>\n\n        <li class=\"li\">2: <samp class=\"codeph \">BEFORE_UPDATE</samp>\n</li>\n\n        <li class=\"li\">3: <samp class=\"codeph \">AFTER_UPDATE</samp>\n</li>\n\n        <li class=\"li\">4: <samp class=\"codeph \">BEFORE_DELETE</samp>\n</li>\n\n        <li class=\"li\">5: <samp class=\"codeph \">AFTER_DELETE</samp>\n</li>\n\n        <li class=\"li\">6: <samp class=\"codeph \">AFTER_UNDELETE</samp>\n</li>\n\n      </ul>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div><div id=\"sfdc:seealso\" class=\"related-links\"></div>"}